  "description": {
   "zh": "This is a world that is no different from modern society during the day, but once the dusk dividing line is crossed, darkness is forcibly opened, and it becomes a world where evil spirits and ghosts roam the night. My original world had just been destroyed, and when I traveled to the new world it was the end of the world again? It’s the end of the world, but I’m also possessed by an evil spirit? Being chased by villagers? Faced with various survival crises, how can I hide my identity as a traveler and survive?"
  },
